{"seq":1,"slug":"llm-rerank","title":"LLM 重排的延迟与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/ranking-frontiers/llm-rerank","wordCount":3298,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"llm-重排的延迟与成本\">LLM 重排的延迟与成本</h1><p>生成式模型进入排序栈的方式与传统模型很不一样：它不是替换精排模型，而是先被放在重排位置——只处理几十条候选，用一次生成式计算给出它们的顺序。这个位置选择是刻意的，因为 LLM 的成本结构不允许它看更多候选，而重排的候选量恰好小到可以承受。但&quot;可以承受&quot;是个很松的说法：一个请求花多少 token、多少毫秒、多少钱，取决于候选数、文档长度、以及输出格式的设计，这些参数的组合空间很大，而其中大部分组合在线上是不可行的。这一篇把账单算清楚。</p>\n<p>本篇承接 <a href=\"../ranking-funnel/cascade-stages\">召回、粗排、精排、重排的延迟预算分配</a> 给出的重排预算，讨论在几十条候选上做生成式重排的实际可行性边界；与 <a href=\"late-interaction\">多向量与 late interaction 模型</a> 的关系是：那一篇给出了一条算力上更省的替代路线，两者常被放在一起比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一次重排请求的-token-账单\">核心概念：一次重排请求的 token 账单</h2><p>LLM 重排的输入是&quot;查询 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条候选的文本&quot;，输出是这些候选的一个排列（或每个候选的分数）。成本可以用 token 数分解。设查询长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单条候选的文本长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、候选数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>、指令模板长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则输入 token 数近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Tok</mtext><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>sep</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Tok}_{\\text{in}} \\approx L_s + L_q + k \\cdot (L_d + L_{\\text{sep}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tok</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sep</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>输出侧取决于格式：如果只输出一个排列（比如&quot;3,1,7,2,...&quot;），输出 token 数约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot \\log k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的数值位数，很小；如果要求每个候选输出一个分数与理由，输出 token 数会接近输入的量级，成本翻倍甚至更多。</p>\n<p>把这两个数放进两个约束里，可行性边界就出来了。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟约束</strong>：在预填充与解码两段上分别看。预填充（prefill）阶段是并行的，耗时近似与输入 token 数线性但不含自回归的串行依赖；解码（decode）阶段每个 token 一次前向，是串行的。所以如果输出长度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单步解码耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，仅解码就至少要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{out}} \\cdot t_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个量是<strong>无法通过增加算力消除的</strong>——它是自回归的物理下限。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>LLM</mtext></msub><mo>≳</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>prefill</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Tok</mtext><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{LLM}} \\gtrsim t_{\\text{prefill}}(\\text{Tok}_{\\text{in}}) + T_{\\text{out}} \\cdot t_{\\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LLM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prefill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tok</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>成本约束</strong>：token 是计费的，按输入与输出分别计价。若输入的单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单请求成本为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Tok</mtext><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\text{Tok}_{\\text{in}} \\cdot p_{\\text{in}} + T_{\\text{out}} \\cdot p_{\\text{out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tok</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举个量级的例子说明边界：若候选 50 条、每条文档 200 token、模板 100 token，则输入约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 + 10 + 50 \\times 210 \\approx 10\\,600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">210</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span> token。输出若为纯排列约 100 token。以典型 API 价格量级估算，单请求成本在 0.01 美元上下；每秒钟一万次请求就意味着每秒上百美元。这个数量级解释了为什么 LLM 重排在生产上几乎总是与&quot;只在部分流量上启用&quot;、&quot;只在部分查询上启用&quot;、&quot;先蒸馏再上线&quot;这三件事绑定出现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>影响延迟的方式</th>\n<th>影响成本的方式</th>\n<th>可行的取值思路</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>候选数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>预填充线性增长</td>\n<td>输入 token 线性增长</td>\n<td>20–50，超过要重估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>预填充线性</td>\n<td>输入 token 线性</td>\n<td>截断到关键片段，不用全文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出格式</td>\n<td>解码长度直接决定串行耗时</td>\n<td>输出 token 计费更高</td>\n<td>只输出排列，不输出理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>常数</td>\n<td>常数（但占固定成本）</td>\n<td>精简指令，复用前缀缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否批处理</td>\n<td>批内摊薄，但推高首 token 延迟</td>\n<td>提高吞吐、降低成本</td>\n<td>在线用中批，离线用大批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[查询 + 50 条候选] --&gt; B[构造提示 模板+查询+k×文档]&#10;    B --&gt; C[预填充阶段 并行处理输入]&#10;    C --&gt; D[KV 缓存生成]&#10;    D --&gt; E[解码阶段 逐 token 生成排列]&#10;    E --&gt; F[解析输出为位次]&#10;    F --&gt; G{输出是否符合约束}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[重试或回退到统计模型]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[作为重排结果进入混排]&#10;    C --&gt; J[前缀缓存复用系统提示]&#10;    J --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[查询 + 50 条候选] --&gt; B[构造提示 模板+查询+k×文档]\n    B --&gt; C[预填充阶段 并行处理输入]\n    C --&gt; D[KV 缓存生成]\n    D --&gt; E[解码阶段 逐 token 生成排列]\n    E --&gt; F[解析输出为位次]\n    F --&gt; G{输出是否符合约束}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[重试或回退到统计模型]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[作为重排结果进入混排]\n    C --&gt; J[前缀缓存复用系统提示]\n    J --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"把-llm-放进漏斗的哪个位置\">把 LLM 放进漏斗的哪个位置</h2><p>把 LLM 放在重排（只看 20–50 条）与放在精排（要看几百条）的差别，不只是成本乘以十。影响位置的三个因素：</p>\n<p><strong>因素一：信息充分性。</strong> 重排看到的候选是精排筛过的，因此 LLM 只能在&quot;已经不错的结果里&quot;做微调。如果精排的模型有明显缺陷（比如对长尾查询打分不准），把 LLM 放在后面救不回来——因为好候选已经被精排扔掉了。这是 <a href=\"../ranking-funnel/early-exit\">级联截断与早退优化</a> 中&quot;截断损失不可逆&quot;的直接后果。</p>\n<p><strong>因素二：LLM 的比较优势。</strong> LLM 相对于传统交叉编码器的优势通常体现在需要<strong>语义推理</strong>的判断上：查询含否定（&quot;不含荧光剂的洗衣液&quot;）、含多约束（&quot;适合小户型、噪音低、预算两千内的空调&quot;）、或者需要常识（&quot;适合送刚学走路的孩子的礼物&quot;）。这类查询占比不高，但价值高。因此&quot;把 LLM 放在重排&quot;的真正含义是<strong>只对这类查询启用</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>因素三：批处理的可行性。</strong> 重排的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 小，所以一个查询可以放进一次请求；精排的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 大，要么切成多次请求（增加延迟与成本）、要么用滑动窗口在多次调用间传递状态（这是 listwise 重排的常见做法，如 RankGPT 在 2023 年提出的滑动窗口置换策略，每次只看窗口内若干条并携带上一窗口的顺序信息——来源：Sun et al., &quot;Is ChatGPT Good at Search? Investigating Large Language Models as Re-Ranking Agents&quot;, EMNLP 2023, arXiv:2304.09542, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.09542）。滑窗的代价是调用次数与\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.09542）。滑窗的代价是调用次数与</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比，尾延迟随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 增长。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插入位置</th>\n<th>候选数</th>\n<th>单请求 token 量级</th>\n<th>延迟可行性</th>\n<th>效果上限</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>召回后</td>\n<td>数千</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>+</td>\n<td>不可行</td>\n<td>最高（理论）</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排位置</td>\n<td>数百</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需滑窗，尾延迟高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高价值小流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排位置</td>\n<td>20–50</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可行（几十到几百 ms）</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>主流选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混排后微调</td>\n<td>10–20</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可行</td>\n<td>低（只能微调）</td>\n<td>特定约束场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[精排输出的 top 50] --&gt; B{查询是否属于推理类}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[LLM 重排 一次请求看 50 条]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[统计重排 交叉编码器]&#10;    C --&gt; E{延迟是否超预算}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[采用 LLM 顺序]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[回退统计重排结果]&#10;    D --&gt; H[输出最终序]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[精排输出的 top 50] --&gt; B{查询是否属于推理类}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[LLM 重排 一次请求看 50 条]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[统计重排 交叉编码器]\n    C --&gt; E{延迟是否超预算}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[采用 LLM 顺序]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[回退统计重排结果]\n    D --&gt; H[输出最终序]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"四种把成本压下来的手段\">四种把成本压下来的手段</h2><p><strong>手段一：蒸馏。</strong> 用一个 LLM 教师离线为海量查询-候选对打分，训练一个小的学生模型（交叉编码器或双塔）来模仿教师的排序偏好。学生上线后单条成本降一到两个数量级，而排序质量能保住大部分——前提是教师覆盖了线上的查询分布（来源：Hinton, Vinyals &amp; Dean, &quot;Distilling the Knowledge in a Neural Network&quot;, arXiv:1503.02531, 2015, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。这条路线是\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.02531）。这条路线是</a> <a href=\"../ranking-funnel/model-cost-quality\">模型复杂度与效果的权衡</a> 中&quot;蒸馏保形&quot;策略的具体实例。它的一个实际约束是：学生模型学的是教师的偏好，因此教师在某些查询上的系统性偏差会被固化；上线后需要监控学生与教师在抽样上的排序一致性，偏差扩大就意味着需要用新数据重新蒸馏。</p>\n<p><strong>手段二：缓存与预计算。</strong> LLM 重排的结果对&quot;查询 + 候选集合&quot;是确定性的，因此可以缓存。缓存命中率取决于查询的集中度：头部查询集中度高，缓存能覆盖相当比例的流量；长尾查询则几乎无命中。更有效的变体是<strong>部分缓存</strong>——缓存&quot;查询 × 单条文档&quot;的分数，这样即使候选集合变化，只要文档重复出现就能复用。这实际上把 listwise 重排变成了 pointwise 打分，失去了候选间比较的信息，需要在效果上权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>手段三：前缀缓存与注意力复用。</strong> 系统提示（指令模板）在所有请求间相同，是输入里占比不小的一块。现代推理框架支持前缀缓存（prefix caching），把共享前缀的 KV 缓存复用，避免重复预填充。SGLang 在 2023 年底提出的 RadixAttention 用基数树管理 KV 缓存前缀，报告在多轮与共享前缀场景下有数倍吞吐提升（来源：Zheng et al., &quot;SGLang: Efficient Execution of Structured Language Model Programs&quot;, arXiv:2312.07104（v1 2023-12），报告最高 6.4× 吞吐提升；另有 LMSYS 官方博客 &quot;Fast and Expressive LLM Inference with RadixAttention and SGLang&quot;, 2024-01-17, <a href=\"https://lmsys.org/blog/2024-01-17-sglang/）。对重排场景而言，把指令模板放在输入最前面、保持逐字节一致，就是让前缀缓存能命中的具体动作。vLLM\">https://lmsys.org/blog/2024-01-17-sglang/）。对重排场景而言，把指令模板放在输入最前面、保持逐字节一致，就是让前缀缓存能命中的具体动作。vLLM</a> 也提供同类能力（Automatic Prefix Caching，<code>enable_prefix_caching=True</code>，只加速预填充阶段；来源：vLLM 官方文档, <a href=\"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/automatic_prefix_caching.html）。代价是模板一旦修改，全部缓存失效，因此模板版本应作为缓存键的一部分显式管理。\">https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/automatic_prefix_caching.html）。代价是模板一旦修改，全部缓存失效，因此模板版本应作为缓存键的一部分显式管理。</a></p>\n<p><strong>手段四：输出格式与解码长度控制。</strong> 前面算过，解码是自回归的串行成本。因此&quot;让 LLM 输出理由&quot;这个看起来很自然的做法会直接把延迟翻倍——理由的长度通常是排列本身的几十倍。另一个易被忽视的点是<strong>约束解码</strong>：要求输出严格是候选 ID 的排列，可以用受限解码（constrained decoding）在生成时就排除非法 token，避免生成后再校验重试。重试的代价很高（一次完整的解码），所以能通过解码约束消除的重试是纯收益（来源：SGLang 的受限解码/结构化输出支持, arXiv:2312.07104, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104）。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>成本降低幅度</th>\n<th>效果损失</th>\n<th>主要实现风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蒸馏到小模型</td>\n<td>一到两个数量级</td>\n<td>小（取决于教师覆盖）</td>\n<td>教师偏差被固化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果缓存</td>\n<td>与命中率成正比</td>\n<td>无（结果相同）</td>\n<td>冷启动、TTL 与新鲜度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分缓存（查询×文档）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（丢失候选间比较）</td>\n<td>语义从 listwise 变 pointwise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀缓存</td>\n<td>预填充部分大幅下降</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>模板变更导致全量失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只输出排列不输出理由</td>\n<td>解码延迟降数倍</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>可解释性丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受限解码</td>\n<td>消除重试</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"观测-llm-重排在线上应该盯什么\">观测：LLM 重排在线上应该盯什么</h2><p>LLM 重排的观测维度比传统模型多，因为它引入了新的失败模式：输出格式不合规、输出与输入候选集合不匹配（幻觉出不存在的 ID）、以及延迟的方差极大（受 batch 组成影响）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>为什么需要</th>\n<th>异常时的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出格式合规率</td>\n<td>约束解码失效或模板漂移</td>\n<td>收紧解码约束、检查模板版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出 ID 落域率</td>\n<td>幻觉出候选集合外的 ID</td>\n<td>加严格校验与回退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首 token 延迟（TTFT）</td>\n<td>反映预填充与排队</td>\n<td>调批大小、加副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单请求输出 token 数</td>\n<td>解码延迟的直接驱动</td>\n<td>检查是否输出了理由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与统计重排的序一致性</td>\n<td>判断 LLM 是否在有效工作</td>\n<td>一致性过高说明无增益（白花钱）；过低说明有问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位查询成本</td>\n<td>成本是否失控</td>\n<td>收紧启用条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退率</td>\n<td>有多少请求没用上 LLM 结果</td>\n<td>若过高，说明稳定性不足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;与统计重排的序一致性&quot;是一个双向指标，很有用。如果 LLM 的输出与统计模型高度一致，说明它没有带来新信息，成本是白花的；如果差异极大，可能是它在做错事。理想的区间是&quot;有显著差异且效果指标更好&quot;，这个区间需要通过 A/B 实验确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>LLM 重排的可行性完全由账单决定，而账单由候选数、文档长度、输出格式三个参数主导。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延迟下界是预填充加解码的串行成本，解码是自回归的物理下限，无法靠加算力消除；输出理由会让解码长度翻几十倍，是最容易被忽视的延迟来源。</li>\n<li>位置选择的本质是取舍：放重排（20–50 条）可行但只能微调；放精排（数百条）需滑动窗口，尾延迟随候选数增长；放召回后不可行。</li>\n<li>真正合适的场景是需要语义推理的查询（否定、多约束、常识），这类查询占比小但价值高，因此&quot;按查询启用&quot;是标准做法。</li>\n<li>四种压成本手段：蒸馏（降一到两个数量级）、缓存（结果缓存或查询×文档部分缓存）、前缀缓存与注意力复用（模板放最前并保持逐字节一致）、只输出排列 + 受限解码。</li>\n<li>观测要覆盖新失败模式（格式合规率、ID 落域率、TTFT、输出 token 数）以及一个双向指标——与统计重排的序一致性，过高是白花钱，过低是有问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>另一条路线不追求更强的模型，而是把算力搬到离用户更近的地方，见 <a href=\"edge-ranking\">边缘与端侧轻量排序</a>；而如果目标是&quot;接近 LLM 效果但算力低得多&quot;，多向量与 late interaction 表示提供了另一种平衡，见 <a href=\"late-interaction\">多向量与 late interaction 模型</a>。把 LLM 成本压下来的蒸馏思路与 <a href=\"../ranking-funnel/model-cost-quality\">模型复杂度与效果的权衡</a> 中的边际收益分析是同一套框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LLM 重排的延迟与成本","id":"llm-重排的延迟与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一次重排请求的 token 账单","id":"核心概念-一次重排请求的-token-账单"},{"level":2,"text":"把 LLM 放进漏斗的哪个位置","id":"把-llm-放进漏斗的哪个位置"},{"level":2,"text":"四种把成本压下来的手段","id":"四种把成本压下来的手段"},{"level":2,"text":"观测：LLM 重排在线上应该盯什么","id":"观测-llm-重排在线上应该盯什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混排超时下的保底策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/blending-engine/blending-fallback"},"next":{"title":"边缘与端侧轻量排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/ranking-blending-performance/ranking-frontiers/edge-ranking"}}